;; compiler/emit/lower/arith.fib: arithmetic: native methods of the scalar protocols, conversions, overflow traps.
;; Replaces crates/fibc/src/lower/arith.rs.
;; STATUS: every public function below is a STUB of package E5, `(trap "todo: PACKAGE NAME")`,
;; with the Rust it replaces in the comment above it (crates/fibc/src/lower/arith.rs, 277 lines of Rust).
;; A stub reached makes a tool exit 70 (pending, never a pass); its signature is final for the callers,
;; the data it names is the porter's to extend.
